{"created": "2025-06-03T10:58:12.702421+00:00", "modified": "2025-06-03T10:58:16.489422+00:00", "id": 15497193, "conceptrecid": "15497192", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15497193", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15497192", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15497193", "metadata": {"title": "INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 Lithium-Ion Battery Cell Direct Characterization Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15497193", "publication_date": "2025-05-23", "description": "<h1>Scope</h1>\n<p>This record contains characterization data of components harvested from INR18650-LG-3500-MJ1 #001 cell used in the DLReps project. The characterization was performed using a combination of destructive techniques including half-cell electrochemical testing, SEM, and EDX analysis. The source data is contained in the files <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/MJ1_parameters.xlsx\">MJ1_parameters.xlsx</a> and <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/MJ1-Parameters.pptx\">MJ1-Parameters.pptx</a>, which is then processed to obtain the extracted and encapsulated data (images and parquet files).</p>\n<h1>Files</h1>\n<h2>Source Data</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/MJ1_parameters.xlsx\">MJ1_parameters.xlsx</a></td>\n<td>A collection of parameters obtained from laboratory characterization of MJ1 battery cells.</td>\n<td>Excel spreadsheet (<code>.xlsx</code>)</td>\n<td>Contains raw experimental data for parameter extraction and further processing.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/MJ1-Parameters.pptx\">MJ1-Parameters.pptx</a></td>\n<td>A PowerPoint presentation summarizing the MJ1 battery cell parameters.</td>\n<td>PowerPoint presentation (<code>.pptx</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides a visual summary of the characterization results.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Processing Scripts</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/Negative_electrode_exchange_current_density_A_per_m2.py\">Negative_electrode_exchange_current_density_A_per_m2.py</a></td>\n<td>Python script for calculating the exchange current density of the negative electrode.</td>\n<td>Python script (<code>.py</code>)</td>\n<td>Processes data to extract electrochemical parameters related to the negative electrode.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/excel_parsing.py\">excel_parsing.py</a></td>\n<td>A script for parsing and cleaning data from Excel files.</td>\n<td>Python script (<code>.py</code>)</td>\n<td>Structures raw data for further processing and analysis.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/Positive_electrode_exchange_current_density_A_per_m2.py\">Positive_electrode_exchange_current_density_A_per_m2.py</a></td>\n<td>Python script for calculating the exchange current density of the positive electrode.</td>\n<td>Python script (<code>.py</code>)</td>\n<td>Processes data to extract electrochemical parameters related to the positive electrode.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Notebooks</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/demonstrate_metadata_processing.ipynb\">demonstrate_metadata_processing.ipynb</a></td>\n<td>A Jupyter notebook demonstrating the usage of metadata processing techniques.</td>\n<td>Jupyter notebook (<code>.ipynb</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides an example workflow for integrating and processing metadata.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>FAIR Implementation</h2>\n<h3>Tabular Data</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/conductivity_in_electrolyte_at_a_function_of_temperature.parquet\">conductivity_in_electrolyte_at_a_function_of_temperature.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing electrolyte conductivity as a function of temperature.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Enables efficient querying and analysis of conductivity data.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_coefficient_in_electrolyte_at_a_function_of_temperature.parquet\">diffusion_coefficient_in_electrolyte_at_a_function_of_temperature.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for diffusion coefficients of electrolytes at varying temperatures.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Supports FAIR-compliant analysis of electrolyte diffusion properties.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_graphite_silicon_oxide_charging.parquet\">diffusion_graphite_silicon_oxide_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data representing diffusion coefficients for graphite-silicon oxide during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Facilitates analysis of diffusion characteristics during charging cycles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_graphite_silicon_oxide_discharging.parquet\">diffusion_graphite_silicon_oxide_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data representing diffusion coefficients for graphite-silicon oxide during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Facilitates analysis of diffusion characteristics during discharging cycles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_nmc_charging.parquet\">diffusion_nmc_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for diffusion coefficients in NMC during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Enables detailed analysis of material behavior in charging conditions.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_nmc_discharging.parquet\">diffusion_nmc_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for diffusion coefficients in NMC during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Enables detailed analysis of material behavior in discharging conditions.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/exchange_current_density_graphite_silicon_oxide_charging.parquet\">exchange_current_density_graphite_silicon_oxide_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for exchange current density in graphite-silicon oxide during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Assists in electrochemical modeling and analysis during charging.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/exchange_current_density_graphite_silicon_oxide_discharging.parquet\">exchange_current_density_graphite_silicon_oxide_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for exchange current density in graphite-silicon oxide during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Assists in electrochemical modeling and analysis during discharging.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_nmc_charging.parquet\">exchange_current_density_nmc_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for exchange current density in NMC during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Supports electrochemical analysis for charging processes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/diffusion_nmc_discharging.parquet\">exchange_current_density_nmc_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data for exchange current density in NMC during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Supports electrochemical analysis for discharging processes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_graphite_silicon_oxide_charging.parquet\">pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_graphite_silicon_oxide_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing pseudo-open circuit voltage for graphite-silicon oxide during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Useful for voltage behavior analysis during charging cycles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_graphite_silicon_oxide_discharging.parquet\">pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_graphite_silicon_oxide_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing pseudo-open circuit voltage for graphite-silicon oxide during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Useful for voltage behavior analysis during discharging cycles.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_nmc_charging.parquet\">pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_nmc_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing pseudo-open circuit voltage for NMC during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Facilitates modeling and analysis of voltage characteristics during charging.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_nmc_discharging.parquet\">pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_nmc_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing pseudo-open circuit voltage for NMC during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Facilitates modeling and analysis of voltage characteristics during discharging.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_silicon_literature_charging.parquet\">pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_silicon_literature_charging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing pseudo-open circuit voltage for silicon (from literature) during charging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides reference data for silicon voltage analysis.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_silicon_literature_discharging.parquet\">pseudo_open_circuit_voltage_silicon_literature_discharging.parquet</a></td>\n<td>Tabular data showing pseudo-open circuit voltage for silicon (from literature) during discharging.</td>\n<td>Parquet file (<code>.parquet</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides reference data for silicon voltage analysis.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Image Data</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_computed_tomography_snapshot.png\">inr18650_mj1_computed_tomography_snapshot.png</a></td>\n<td>Computed tomography snapshot of the INR18650 MJ1 battery cell.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides structural visualization of the battery cell.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_disassembly_process.png\">inr18650_mj1_disassembly_process.png</a></td>\n<td>Image documenting the disassembly process of the MJ1 cell.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Illustrates the disassembly procedure for component characterization.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_electrode_schematic.png\">inr18650_mj1_electrode_schematic.png</a></td>\n<td>Schematic illustration of the MJ1 cell electrode structure.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Useful for visualizing electrode design and components.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_graphite_silicon_oxide_sem.png\">inr18650_mj1_graphite_silicon_oxide_sem.png</a></td>\n<td>Scanning electron microscope (SEM) image of graphite-silicon oxide.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Supports morphological analysis of the electrode material.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_graphite_silicon_oxide_sem_edx.png\">inr18650_mj1_graphite_silicon_oxide_sem_edx.png</a></td>\n<td>SEM image with energy-dispersive X-ray spectroscopy (EDX) of graphite-silicon oxide.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides compositional analysis of electrode materials.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_jellyroll.png\">inr18650_mj1_jellyroll.png</a></td>\n<td>Image of the jellyroll structure from the MJ1 cell.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Displays the internal structure of the battery cell.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_jellyroll_side.png\">inr18650_mj1_jellyroll_side.png</a></td>\n<td>Side view of the jellyroll structure from the MJ1 cell.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides additional perspective on the internal cell design.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_negative_electrode_cross_section.png\">inr18650_mj1_negative_electrode_cross_section.png</a></td>\n<td>Cross-sectional image of the MJ1 cell's negative electrode.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Useful for structural analysis of the negative electrode.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_nmc_sem.png\">inr18650_mj1_nmc_sem.png</a></td>\n<td>SEM image of NMC material from the MJ1 cell.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides detailed imaging of NMC material morphology.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_nmc_sem_edx.png\">inr18650_mj1_nmc_sem_edx.png</a></td>\n<td>SEM image with EDX of NMC material.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Enables compositional analysis of NMC material.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_partially_disassembled.png\">inr18650_mj1_partially_disassembled.png</a></td>\n<td>Image showing the partially disassembled MJ1 cell.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Documents intermediate stages of disassembly.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_positive_electrode_cross_section.png\">inr18650_mj1_positive_electrode_cross_section.png</a></td>\n<td>Cross-sectional image of the MJ1 cell's positive electrode.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Supports structural analysis of the positive electrode.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_separator_ceramic_coating_sem.png\">inr18650_mj1_separator_ceramic_coating_sem.png</a></td>\n<td>SEM image of the separator's ceramic coating.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Analyzes the separator's protective ceramic layer.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/inr18650_mj1_separator_polymer_matrix_sem.png\">inr18650_mj1_separator_polymer_matrix_sem.png</a></td>\n<td>SEM image of the separator's polymer matrix.</td>\n<td>PNG image (<code>.png</code>)</td>\n<td>Provides structural information about the separator material.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Metadata</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Filename</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Usage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/15497193/files/metadata.jsonld\">metadata.jsonld</a></td>\n<td>JSON-LD file providing semantic metadata for all files in the repository.</td>\n<td>JSON-LD (<code>.jsonld</code>)</td>\n<td>Ensures FAIR compliance by linking metadata to relevant ontologies and enabling semantic interoperability.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>Related Resources</h1>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">